{"version":1,"content":"<p>AMD旗下備受遊戲玩家關注的鋭龍7 9800X3D處理器近日迎來新一輪降價。美國零售商Newegg通過促銷優惠碼，將這款處理器的售價從469美元降至399美元，一次性優惠70美元，創下今年以來的最低價格。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585498.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.589173+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:21:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"120e34dd6995fbee32cde44752f710b57e71f25b5fd1e54e1ebe20eeb605e899","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}